'''Elections to [[Southampton City Council]]''' took place on Thursday 5 May 2022, alongside nationwide local elections, alongside other [[2022 United Kingdom local elections|local elections]] across the country. The seats up for election were last contested in [[2018 Southampton City Council election|2018]]. The [[Labour Party (UK)|Labour Party]] regained control of the council from the [[Conservative Party (UK)|Conservative Party]], which it had lost at the [[2021 Southampton City Council election|previous year's elections]].<ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/election/2022/england/councils/E06000045|title=Southampton election result|publisher=[[BBC News]]|accessdate=7 May 2022}}</ref>

